BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_316979229@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261017T041204Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261023T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261023T110000
SUMMARY:🥾 Hemlock Falls and Orange Reservoir 
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nLet's Walk in South Mountain Reservation.\n\nWe'
 ll start in the Tulip Springs parking lot off Cherry Ln in West Orange. We
  will follow the yellow trail and visit Hobble and **Hemlock Falls.** It w
 ill be a great time to view both falls if we get rain this week.\n\nNext\,
  we will retrace our steps to the Reservoir Trail and walk through the woo
 ds until we reach the connector and take it down the hill to the paved pat
 h. We'll make almost 1 full loop of the lake and then follow a short trail
  back to the Tulip Springs parking lot.\n\nWe will be walking about 3.4 mi
 les on various surfaces in the woods and around the lake\, so please wear 
 sturdy shoes with good traction. **NO SNEAKERS\, please.** Some will find 
 a walking stick helpful especially when descending the connector trail.\n\
 n**Don't forget to bring water**. We will be walking for 90-120 minutes\n\
 n**Please make sure to RSVP and arrive 5 minutes prior to start time.**\nF
 OLLOW US ON INSTAGRAM - letswalkmeetup\n\nDisclaimer: If you join us for a
  hike\, please understand that you are responsible for your own preparedne
 ss and well-being and will hold no one else liable in case of injury or mi
 shap. Event will be canceled in the event of extreme weather.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/316979229/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261014T190726Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261014T190726Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_316923205@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261017T041204Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261030T091500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261030T101500
SUMMARY:Eagle Rock Reservation
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nJOIN US FOR A WALK. WE WALK AT A MODERATE PACE O
 N UNPAVED PATHS.\n\nWe will hike for about an hour - 3.5 miles. We will be
  walking on trails in the woods\, so appropriate footwear\, long pants & s
 ocks\, and bug spray.\n\nWill will meet at:\n[https://goo.gl/maps/7rRRTiXC
 ntdE1neD7](https://goo.gl/maps/7rRRTiXCntdE1neD7) Eagle Rock Trail Parking
  Lot by Kiosk#1\n\nIf you enter from Eagle Rock Way\, go pass the Highlawn
  and stay left. There will be a parking lot at the end of the curve to you
 r right.\n\nEagle Rock Reservation is 408 acres of hills\, streams\, and v
 alleys located on the borders of West Orange\, Verona\, and Montclair\, Ne
 w Jersey. Though located in the middle of the most densely populated count
 y in the most densely populated state in the country\, the Reservation is 
 mostly undeveloped and boasts an extensive trail system within its borders
 .\n\n**Please make sure to RSVP and arrive 5 minutes prior to start time.*
 *\n\nFOLLOW US ON INSTAGRAM - letswalkmeetup\n\nDisclaimer: If you join us
  for a hike\, please understand that you are responsible for your own prep
 aredness and well-being and will hold no one else liable in case of injury
  or mishap. Event will be canceled in the event of extreme weather.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/316923205/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261010T133001Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261010T133001Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
